  "totalBlocks": 49,
  "translatedBlocks": 43,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "99244df67f1dcf3a",
      "translationZh": "如今的 Accelerate 是什么？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c75d04996e02564",
      "translationZh": "3.5 年前，Accelerate 还是一个简单的框架，旨在通过底层抽象来简化原生 PyTorch 训练循环，让在多 GPU 和 TPU 系统上进行训练变得更容易：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9eecd49d5dc9de9",
      "translationZh": "此后，Accelerate 已发展为一个功能多样的库，旨在解决大规模训练和大型模型面临的许多常见问题。在这个时代，4050 亿参数（Llama）已成为语言模型的新规模。这些功能包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ba2c68a1c1b76bc2",
      "translationZh": "灵活的底层训练 API，支持在六种不同的硬件加速器（CPU、GPU、TPU、XPU、NPU、MLU）上进行训练，同时保留原始训练循环的 99%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "91f5e3d1155f78f3",
      "translationZh": "易于使用的命令行界面，用于在不同硬件配置下配置和运行脚本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "684aea26ac6e1deb",
      "translationZh": "Big Model Inference（大模型推理）或 device_map=\"auto\" 的诞生地，不仅让用户能够在多个设备上对 LLM 进行推理，如今还通过参数高效微调（PEFT）等技术，帮助用户在有限算力下训练 LLM",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "21b75766127f1843",
      "translationZh": "这三个方面让 Accelerate 成为了 Hugging Face 几乎所有软件包的基础，包括 transformers、diffusers、peft、trl 等！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7414052ca3e67ac0",
      "translationZh": "这个软件包已稳定运行近一年，因此我们很高兴地宣布：就在今天，我们发布了 Accelerate 1.0.0 的首批候选发布版本！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5d645848617bef1",
      "translationZh": "这篇博客将详细介绍：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ce49e789fa46b24b",
      "translationZh": "我们为什么决定推出 1.0？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bc9d1122c120caa6",
      "translationZh": "Accelerate 的未来是什么样的？我们认为 PyTorch 整体将走向何方？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bb039c202da1ac2c",
      "translationZh": "有哪些破坏性变更和弃用项？如何轻松完成迁移？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6894a6b23ece9318",
      "translationZh": "为什么推出 1.0？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df10d7972c3cc5b6",
      "translationZh": "发布 1.0.0 的计划已经酝酿了一年多。API 已经大致达到了我们期望的状态，以 Accelerator 端为中心，简化了大量配置，并提升了可扩展性。不过，我们知道，要称 Accelerate 的“基础部分”已经“功能完备”，还缺少几个环节：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b7d681dc642f4d6a",
      "translationZh": "集成 MS-AMP 和 TransformersEngine 的 FP8 支持（在这里和这里了解更多）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "648a2897094dc134",
      "translationZh": "支持在使用 DeepSpeed 时编排多个模型（实验性）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4aed2bd5f60ae627",
      "translationZh": "为大模型推理 API 提供 torch.compile 支持（要求 torch>=2.5）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a9cb3da0b79245b5",
      "translationZh": "集成 torch.distributed.pipelining，作为另一种分布式推理机制",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "09d899f33a5ff23f",
      "translationZh": "集成 torchdata.StatefulDataLoader，作为另一种数据加载器机制",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2de873beb01cab5",
      "translationZh": "通过为 1.0 所做的这些改动，accelerate 已准备好在保持面向用户的 API 稳定的同时，着手集成新技术。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ed08a8f423daca9f",
      "translationZh": "Accelerate 的未来",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fee489ded5f696ce",
      "translationZh": "如今 1.0 已接近完成，我们可以专注于社区中不断涌现的新技术，并寻找将其集成到 Accelerate 中的途径，因为我们预计 PyTorch 生态系统很快就会发生一些根本性变化：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c58880328ee9fe0c",
      "translationZh": "在实现 DeepSpeed 多模型支持的过程中，我们发现，虽然 DeepSpeed 目前的整体工作方式基本可行，但随着我们致力于支持通过简单封装来为任何多模型训练场景准备模型，最终可能需要对整体 API 做出一些重大调整。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6d7d5fea1764260d",
      "translationZh": "随着 torchao 和 torchtitan 的发展势头日益强劲，它们预示了整个 PyTorch 的未来方向。为了更原生地支持 FP8 训练、提供新的分布式分片 API，并支持新版 FSDP，即 FSDPv2，我们预计，随着这些框架逐渐趋于稳定，Accelerate 的许多内部实现和通用使用 API 都将需要调整（希望调整不会过于剧烈），以满足这些需求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6d1ee401b291b0a0",
      "translationZh": "借助 torchao/FP8，许多新框架正引入不同的思路和实现方式，以使 FP8 训练正常运行并保持稳定（例如 transformer_engine、torchao、MS-AMP、nanotron 等）。我们对 Accelerate 的目标是将这些实现汇集到一处，并提供简单易用的配置，让用户能够随心探索和测试每一种实现，从中找出最终最稳定、最灵活的方案。这是一个正在飞速发展（无意玩双关）的研究领域，尤其是 NVIDIA 对 FP4 训练的支持也即将到来。我们希望确保不仅能够支持这些方法中的每一种，还力求为每种方法提供可靠的基准测试，展示它们在开箱即用（仅做极少调整）的情况下，相较于原生 BF16 训练所呈现的表现特点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86a63409fc5258cc",
      "translationZh": "我们对 PyTorch 生态系统中分布式训练的未来无比期待，也希望确保 Accelerate 能够一路相伴，降低这些新技术的使用门槛。我们希望借此推动社区继续共同实验、共同学习，探索在更复杂的计算系统上训练更大模型并扩展其规模的最佳方法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "22d88408d19ab5da",
      "translationZh": "如何试用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b373c9d1001a867",
      "translationZh": "如需立即试用 Accelerate 的首个候选发布版本，请使用以下方法之一：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e2083a4ca5979a5",
      "translationZh": "有效的发布标签如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "39c40a922535e731",
      "translationZh": "迁移帮助",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0196e0cb974cc386",
      "translationZh": "以下是本次发布中实施的所有弃用变更的完整详情：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b8f7a489501421b5",
      "translationZh": "原先向 Accelerator() 传入 dispatch_batches、split_batches、even_batches 和 use_seedable_sampler 的做法，现在应改为创建一个 accelerate.utils.DataLoaderConfiguration()，并将其传入 Accelerator()（Accelerator(dataloader_config=DataLoaderConfiguration(...)))",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "04e919b115d10b14",
      "translationZh": "Accelerator().use_fp16 和 AcceleratorState().use_fp16 已被移除；应改为检查 accelerator.mixed_precision == \"fp16\"",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "94ef6b5a99dc39a5",
      "translationZh": "Accelerator().autocast() 不再接受 cache_enabled 参数。应改用 AutocastKwargs() 实例来处理此标志（以及其他标志），并将该实例传入 Accelerator（Accelerator(kwargs_handlers=[AutocastKwargs(cache_enabled=True)]))",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "543536b43cfa1d7b",
      "translationZh": "应将 accelerate.utils.is_tpu_available 替换为 accelerate.utils.is_torch_xla_available",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4bbfe500ac775b89",
      "translationZh": "应将 accelerate.utils.modeling.shard_checkpoint 替换为 huggingface_hub 库中的 split_torch_state_dict_into_shards",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a85377525c771279",
      "translationZh": "accelerate.tqdm.tqdm() 不再接受 True/False 作为第一个参数，而应将 main_process_only 作为具名参数传入",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9469d3e590af126e",
      "translationZh": "ACCELERATE_DISABLE_RICH 不再是有效的环境变量，而应通过设置 ACCELERATE_ENABLE_RICH=1 来手动启用 rich 回溯信息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1bcbe255b4e4c10e",
      "translationZh": "FSDP 设置 fsdp_backward_prefetch_policy 已被 fsdp_backward_prefetch 替代",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "26b1ca4c16a05eb8",
      "translationZh": "结束语",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a8469d207512712",
      "translationZh": "非常感谢大家使用 Accelerate；在过去几年里，看着一个小小的想法发展到累计下载量超过 100 million、每日下载量接近 300,000，真是令人惊叹。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ddab76d6842cce68",
      "translationZh": "我们希望通过这个候选发布版，让社区有机会在正式发布前试用并迁移到 1.0。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eec6f04de5a054b8",
      "translationZh": "请持续关注 github 和社交媒体，获取更多信息！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
